{"c":{"6540":["Kirie Goshima","Female","6540.jpg","Kirie Goshima, a schoolgirl in the town of Kurouzucho, becomes concerned with her boyfriend Shuichi Saito’s father who has become obsessed with collecting and staring at spiral patterns to the ignorance of all else.",432],"8459":["Shuuichi Saitou","Male","b8459-y456x3P6mrwY.jpg","Shuichi is Kirie's boyfriend. He is the only one who feels and understands the fact that the town is cursed by the spiral.",346],"13864":["Mitsuru Yamaguchi","Male","b13864-REJCORGEmIXo.jpg","A seventh grader who was in same school as Kirie Goshima who loved to jump out and surprise people. He also had a crush on her.",5],"131720":["Azami Kurotani","Female","n131720-TDRE8X8Mma6O.png","Azami Kurotami is a high school student from Midoriyama-Shi who goes to the same school as Kirie in Kurôzu-Cho.",50],"181025":["Toshio Saitou","Male","b181025-ZBxqzujrTNgu.png","Shuichi's father. One day he stopped going to work to study \"the art of the spiral\", creating an abnormal obsession with that shape.",4],"181026":["Yasuo Goshima","Male","b181026-48BNkIgrn0qK.png","The father of Kirie Goshima and Mitsuo Goshima who is a potter situated next to Dragonfly Pond.",2],"181027":["Keiko Nakayama",null,"b181027-3acBav1XJAwF.png","Kirie's pregnant cousin.",3],"181029":["Yukie Saitou","Female","b181029-klGxqxSykNch.png","Shuichi's mom. After her husband developed an obsession with spirals, she developed an uncontrollable fear for that shape.",2],"181030":["Yoriko Endou","Female","b181030-BqHuPT6yNTQO.png","Kazunori Nishiki's lover.",3],"181031":["Wakabayashi",null,"b181031-gvCfS8wSng5m.png","Neighbors with the Goshima's when they moved into the row house. Had an infatuation to Kirie.",1],"181032":["Dr. Kawamoto",null,"b181032-tMcRVPHAEI68.png","A doctor that delivers (and un-delivers) babies.",1],"181033":["Ikuo Yokota","Male","b181033-cRdsPvOhfgqr.png","Kirie and Shuichi's school teacher.",1],"181034":["Chizuko Goshima","Female","b181034-Zr2VZGq6UXNW.png","Th